id: CTB-SRC0016-12-2
source: SRC-0016
section: §12.2
kind: requirement
extends: LXM-REQ-000195
text: Acceptance principle: LUXORA governs any technology it uses or may use through an open-ended, extensible and auditable lifecycle. The system must not depend on developers maintaining scattered version lists, and it must never equate discovery with verified compatibility.
